[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3927719661","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116478#issuecomment-3927719661","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116478","id":3927719661,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7qHD7t","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-19T14:41:14Z","updated_at":"2026-02-19T14:41:14Z","body":"> When typing in Japanese IME mode (full-width), no InputEventKey logs are generated for the keystrokes or the Enter key.\n\nThis is expected, key presses (including enter) are consumed by system IME driver while it is active, simulated key presses are sent only after XIM `preedit_done` event is received.\n\nWhich input method framework (ibus, fcitx) and method are you using?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3927719661/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3930588828","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116478#issuecomment-3930588828","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116478","id":3930588828,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7qSAac","user":{"login":"mk163","id":69828831,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5ODI4ODMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69828831?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mk163","html_url":"https://github.com/mk163","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mk163/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mk163/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mk163/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mk163/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mk163/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mk163/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mk163/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mk163/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mk163/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-19T22:48:12Z","updated_at":"2026-02-19T22:48:12Z","body":"English/Alphanumeric input: IBus\nJapanese input: Mozc (Google Japanese Input open-source version)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3930588828/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4236319084","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116478#issuecomment-4236319084","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116478","id":4236319084,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc78gRls","user":{"login":"Rindbee","id":30386067,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzg2MDY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30386067?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee","html_url":"https://github.com/Rindbee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-13T12:20:43Z","updated_at":"2026-04-14T12:40:36Z","body":"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ad1468bc-b780-42ab-b95e-d7a6eb8edd3d\n\nI also like enabling the \"preedit\" option because it doesn't obscure too much. Submitting by pressing the Space key may result in an input failure. However, this problem is frequently encountered when using ibus in Godot.  This also happens when using Fcitx5, though not as frequently as when using IBus.\n \n<img width=\"650\" height=\"499\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7d311f19-3d17-4988-8d2d-498f596c77b7\" />\n\n<img width=\"425\" height=\"144\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0c670b68-faee-42ba-87ca-a20f52228124\" />\n\nAccording to [Synchronization Conventions](https://www.x.org/releases/current/doc/libX11/libX11/libX11.html#Synchronization_Conventions) in Xlib - C Language X Interface:\n\n> A KeyPress event with a KeyCode of zero is used exclusively as a signal that an input method has composed input that can be returned by [XmbLookupString](https://www.x.org/releases/current/doc/libX11/libX11/libX11.html#XmbLookupString) or [XwcLookupString](https://www.x.org/releases/current/doc/libX11/libX11/libX11.html#XwcLookupString). No other use is made of a KeyPress event with KeyCode of zero.\n\nI examined the timing of the `_xim_preedit_done_callback()` call and the event with keycode `0`. \n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/1aabcb9e9bc7a222a972731523831ec86b77ee20/platform/linuxbsd/x11/display_server_x11.cpp#L4455-L4458\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/1aabcb9e9bc7a222a972731523831ec86b77ee20/platform/linuxbsd/x11/display_server_x11.cpp#L3940-L3948\n\nPreedit words are dropped when the event (keycode `0`) is processed **before** the callback is invoked. Otherwise, the text will be entered normally.\n\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4236319084/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"off-topic"}}]